#: ../../source/docs/common-airvolute-DroneCore-Suite.rst:7
#: 93a1b7a5dd18412c8cd3806ef8474835
msgid ""
"**DroneCore.Suite** is a one stop autopilot and flight computer solution for"
" developers of advanced drone systems demanding high computing power and "
"high level of modularity. It is the \"core\" of the drone containing most of"
" its electronics in a compact form and it provides wide options for software"
" development of the the most challenging AI and vision based applications."
msgstr ""
"**DroneCore.Suite** "
"是一款面向先进无人机系统开发者的一体化飞控和飞行计算机解决方案，满足对高算力和高度模块化的需求。它是无人机的「核心」，以紧凑形态集成了大部分电子设备，并为最具挑战性的"
" AI 和视觉应用提供丰富的软件开发选项。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-airvolute-DroneCore-Suite.rst:12
#: dac7937034724205932511ee3886f160
msgid ""
