#: ../../source/docs/common-airvolute-DroneCore-Suite.rst:40
#: 1feceb3a004748679c821203929a0aa5
msgid ""
"DroneCore.Suite comes with both Cube and Xavier NX pre-configured and "
"communicating together and able to control a Multicopter. Developers no "
"longer need to solve basic communication and compatibility issues coming "
"from connecting two different IT worlds. It They can start to concentrate on"
" their application needs from the beginning."
msgstr ""
"DroneCore.Suite 出厂时已预先配置好 Cube 和 Xavier NX 之间的通信，可直接控制多旋翼飞行器。开发者无需再解决两个不同 IT"
" 系统互联带来的基本通信和兼容性问题，可以从一开始就专注于应用需求。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-airvolute-DroneCore-Suite.rst:42
#: 0b7da9968cbd4983bc82b4a43433becb
msgid ""
"Accompanying documentation provides a fast learning curve to start using "
"various peripherals to control the drone and create the desired application."
" Various software libraries (coming soon) further enrich the possibilities "
"for the developer relieving them from complex configuration and programming "
"tasks."
msgstr ""
"随附文档可帮助快速掌握各种外设的使用方式，以控制无人机并创建所需应用。多种软件库（即将推出）进一步丰富了开发者的可能性，将其从复杂的配置和编程任务中解放出来。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-airvolute-DroneCore-Suite.rst:45
#: 89fc5cca538246718e53a538796aacfd
msgid ""
"DroneCore.Suite provides easy to use ROS based software stack supporting "
"development of autonomous applications."
msgstr "DroneCore.Suite 提供易于使用的基于 ROS 的软件栈，支持自主应用开发。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-airvolute-DroneCore-Suite.rst:47
#: a964ebc9eb204dbd9a0d29a3bbf995c7
msgid ""
"Out of the box the device is configured to fly a Quadcopter (though "
"autopilot calibration is needed)."
msgstr "开箱即可配置为飞行四轴飞行器（但仍需进行飞控校准）。"

